{"pageid":3461,"title":"Version 1.16.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.16.0</span>","revid":15572,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.16.0\">Version 1.16.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 3rd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_Content:\">New Content:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added the <a href=\"/wiki/Elevator\" title=\"Elevator\">Elevator</a>! (can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine</a>)</li>\n<li>Added the <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Vinyl_Player\" title=\"Blue Vinyl Player\">Blue Vinyl Player</a></li>\n<li>Added 15 unique <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Vinyls\" title=\"Category:Vinyls\">vinyls</a> which can be bought all around the map</li>\n<li>If two players hold a <a href=\"/wiki/Linked_Sword\" title=\"Linked Sword\">linked sword</a>, you can now fight!</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup\" title=\"Mysterious Teacup\">Mysterious Teacups</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Kallostide\" title=\"Kallostide\">Kallostide</a> now have <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Stat Tool</a> details</li>\n<li>New main region music by Chrythm</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Stat Tool</a> no longer requires permission to view details</li>\n<li>Various items are now moved around in stores</li>\n<li>Internal changes to the placement system for structure data</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Stat Tool</a> bug where clicking still detected last hovered object</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163727\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPrep